WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:11.200
This programme is the heart of

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:12.200
who we are.

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:36.300
It's not only about listening and 
understanding customers, but also

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:37.900
listening and understanding

00:00:37.940 --> 00:00:40.120
the communities where we serve in.

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:20.420
I think people here are showing the true Prudential spirit,

00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:23.100
the true humanitarian spirit.

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:25.580
It makes us better as a company

00:01:25.700 --> 00:01:28.000
because we make better products, better services;

00:01:28.220 --> 00:01:29.340
because we have a heart.

00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:30.500
That's who we are.

